        {
          "text": " Ewaikus loka ari naka eŋalakimak enyouni kamodiŋ naka Sin kiririkina Edom, eikorukus da loka ari naka eŋalakimak enyouni kosane loka Aŋolol naka Abalaŋ kobei kide: ",
